#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"The constants B<SHUT_RD>, B<SHUT_WR>, B<SHUT_RDWR> have the value 0, 1, 2, "
"respectively, and are defined in I<E<lt>sys/socket.hE<gt>> since "
"glibc-2.1.91."
msgstr ""
"Les constantes B<SHUT_RD>, B<SHUT_WR>, B<SHUT_RDWR> ont pour valeur 0, 1, et "
"2 respectivement, et sont définies dans I<E<lt>sys/socket.hE<gt>> depuis la "
"glibc-2.1.91."

#. type: SH
